# Density Compare
# Zinc (Zn) — real density 7.14 g/cm³. equal masses: Zinc vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Zinc Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 10.4mm material: zinc at (-20mm, 5.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 56.9 g — the water cube is the reference
